        🔴 RECORD-TYPE PICKLIST RESTRICTION ON THIS FIELD IS NOW MEASURED, NOT REPO-ASSERTED. The
        developer agent reproduced `INVALID_OR_NULL_FOR_RESTRICTED_PICKLIST` inserting a
